  "title": "Roasted Vegetable Orzo",
  "description": "Wonderful summer vegetables - zucchini, summer squash, asparagus, and mushrooms - are roasted and mixed with warm orzo and Parmesan cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle"
  ],
